HOW IZ I FUSE_ESTIMATE YR PRIOR AN YR MEAS AN YR GAIN
    I HAS A TERM1 ITZ PRODUKT OF GAIN AN PRIOR
    I HAS A TERM2 ITZ PRODUKT OF DIFF OF 1.0 AN GAIN AN MEAS
    FOUND YR SUM OF TERM1 AN TERM2
IF U SAY SO

